agentic-coding-practices
=========================

This project is a curated, extended derivative. Portions of the rules, agent
definitions, and skills originate from:

  Everything Claude Code (ECC): https://github.com/affaan-m/everything-claude-code
  Copyright (c) Affaan Mustafa, MIT License

Workflow specifications under source/workflows/ are runtime-neutral ports of
orchestration "formulas"; the original runtime-coupled forms are not included.

The architecture principles in source/rules/common/architecture.md adapt the
Dartantic Architecture Best Practices
(https://github.com/csells/dartantic/wiki/Architecture-Best-Practices).

External patterns referenced/incorporated:
  Augmented Coding Patterns: https://lexler.github.io/augmented-coding-patterns/
  SlopCodeBench code-erosion rubric (source/rules/common/anti-slop.md,
    source/skills/slop-check/): https://www.scbench.ai
    https://github.com/SprocketLab/slop-code-bench
